# Release Hardening

Before any "final build", "packaging", or release handoff:

- Run compile checks on edited modules.
- Run project verification suite (`verify_all.py`) when feasible.
- Run targeted stress/bench checks for changed runtime paths.
- Verify all UI modes launch with primary workflow visible.
- Verify HUD open/resize/compact presets remain stable.
- Confirm disconnect/backpressure scenarios do not freeze UI.
- Ensure no accidental debug leftovers (temporary prints, dev toggles).
- Ensure version/release metadata is updated intentionally.

Release summary should include:
- What changed
- What was tested
- Known risks or deferred follow-ups
